[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/talk/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n4_ranulf"
text = "# DRAFT
# Ranulf at dusk, filling the censers in the choir (night 4, fog). Smooth. (He wears the horned costume. Nothing here says so.)
# The abbot has doubled the incense again; Ranulf wants the porter in the choir at Matins, not by the door (from night 4
# the door is where a man can keep out of the smoke). His remedy: taken (n3_took_remedy) or refused (n3_refused_remedy).
# Asking what is kept in the crypt is the wrong question to the wrong brother (Suspicion +10): he knows who ran last night.
== start
(Ranulf is filling the censers in the choir from a leather bag. The fog has come in at the west door.)
Ranulf: Porter. Mind the step. You can't see the floor tonight.
-> topics

== again
(He goes on filling the censers. The chain clinks.)
Ranulf: Porter. Again.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n4_ranulf_incense] Why so much incense, brother? -> incense
* [if not n4_ranulf_remedy] What is in your remedy, brother? -> remedy
* [if died_crypt_pilgrim] [if not n4_ranulf_crypt] What is kept in the crypt, brother? -> crypt

== incense [set n4_ranulf_incense]
Ranulf: Father Abbot has doubled it again. Four times what we burned at Martinmas.
Ranulf: And your place at Matins is in the choir with us, porter. Not back by the door, where the smoke doesn't reach.
-> topics

== remedy [set n4_ranulf_remedy]
-> remedy_took [if n3_took_remedy]
-> remedy_refused [if n3_refused_remedy]
-> remedy_plain

== remedy_took
Ranulf: Did it ease your head? It will, given time. I'll mix you another whenever you like.
Ranulf: You've only to ask me. Not Thomas. Me.
-> topics

== remedy_refused
Ranulf: You wouldn't take it last night. Thomas had a word in your ear. I saw. Thomas has a word for everyone.
Ranulf: Your head will get worse, porter. Come to me when it does.
-> topics

== remedy_plain
Ranulf: For your headaches. A little poppy, a little honey, nothing more. Come to me after Matins, if your head is bad.
-> topics

# The wrong question to the wrong brother (design doc): Suspicion +10.
== crypt [set n4_ranulf_crypt] [suspicion 10]
(The censer stops halfway to its hook.)
Ranulf: The saint's bones, and the old abbots under them. The stair is kept locked. It's no part of your round.
Ranulf: If you see a light below, porter, it's mine. I keep candles burning for the dead.
-> topics

== leave
Ranulf: In the choir, porter. Not by the door.
"
